{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣天王周杰倫在社交平台Po出《周遊記2》短片為節目宣傳，並寫道：「試探兄弟的脾氣，就是請他來上節目。</p><p>」並叫大家記得收看節目。</p><p>短片一開始，周杰倫就手指指說：「上完節目他脾氣變不好了！</p><p>」鏡頭一轉，見林書豪把救生衣掟給周杰倫，並說：「你去坐！</p><p>我</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T16:21:30.822717+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T16:01:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T16:14:42.084695+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T16:14:42.084695+00:00","content_hash":"d539be3e6bfea92c4f90e12a0e506358f49455b6894093cec2045194c141dc1a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}